# targets' object store: reproducible from _targets.R and the parquet, and large.
_targets/
# Quarto's per-notebook scratch, and the rendered reports. The reports are
# regenerated by `quarto render` from committed inputs; committing 1.5 MB of
# self-contained HTML per notebook would put the output of a run into the diff
# of every change to it.
notebooks/*_cache/
notebooks/*_files/
notebooks/*.html
# Quarto's intermediate markdown, written next to the source during a render.
*.rmarkdown
build-contract_cache/
build-contract_files/
build-contract.html
.Rproj.user/
.Rhistory
